    <p>If AgentShot isn’t for you, write to <a href="mailto:hello@hormuz-labs.dev">hello@hormuz-labs.dev</a> within 14 days of a charge (a plan’s first payment, a renewal or a top-up) and we’ll refund it in full, as long as you have used no more than 10% of the credits that charge granted. After 14 days, or once more of those credits have been used, charges aren’t refunded, except where the law requires it.</p>
    <p>Cancelling stops future renewals; it doesn’t refund the current period. If a fault on our side charges you twice or takes credits for work that failed, we’ll refund the charge or restore the credits. Refunds go back to the original payment method through Dodo Payments; the credits a refunded charge granted are removed. If a payment is disputed or reversed with your bank, we may suspend the plan and the AgentShot key while it’s resolved.</p>
